msgid ""
"{name}: {tag}. {SCORING} The clock warns you 30 seconds before the light "
"fades."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {tag}. {SCORING} O relógio avisa 30 segundos antes de a luz sumir."

msgid "Firefly Meadow"
msgstr "Firefly Meadow"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a challenge, Enter reads its briefing, Escape goes back. "
"Every player gets the same summer evenings: a new one each day, each Monday "
"and each month."
msgstr ""
"Up e Down escolhem um desafio, Enter lê as instruções, Escape volta. Todos "
